Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.18,0:00:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Criss-Cross, are you available to help us?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.56,0:00:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.92,0:00:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,If you really want, I'll protect Jolyne.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.06,0:00:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna take this creepy old geezer out!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.28,0:00:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Direction facing southeast, 127\Ndegrees, 30 minutes, 20 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.40,0:00:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Just be aware you won't survive this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.36,0:00:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,West-southwest, 225 degrees, zero minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.76,0:00:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, FF, he's right behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.72,0:00:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, your real\Nenemy is that insane old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.14,0:00:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.14,0:01:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Now his arm is flying right\Nto the back of FF's head!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.80,0:01:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no freaking way\Nthat was a coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.58,0:01:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,That inmate's glasses flew straight at\NFF and lodged themselves in their face?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.08,0:01:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunate direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.18,0:01:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm starting to understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.20,0:01:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It's feng shui in action.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.82,0:01:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's geomancy for the East Asians.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.22,0:01:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,With that dragon stand, Kenzo can perfectly\Ncontrol the direction of his attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.42,0:01:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,FF, next unlucky spot is here,\Nright above your left ear. Feel it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.02,0:01:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that did just happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.56,0:01:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,My stand attack has merged\Nwith the course of your death.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.18,0:01:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,No! FF!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.66,0:01:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad. Really bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.58,0:01:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't touch them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.00,0:01:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no point.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.32,0:02:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The unlucky direction\Nexists in our bodies, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.30,0:02:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That can only mean one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.84,0:02:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It means that once the direction's chosen,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.76,0:02:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,no organism can defend themselves or\Nescape the cruel inevitability of dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.28,0:02:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,His next target will be...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.40,0:02:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,you, Jolene. Hi-ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.52,0:02:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You misunderstood.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.10,0:02:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,When I said this is bad just now, it\Nwasn't about the giant hole in FF's head.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.14,0:02:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,To be totally honest,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.90,0:02:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,the plain fact that they're injured\Nand bleeding is more of a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.38,0:02:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's the bad thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.68,0:02:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,There's barely any blood at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.44,0:02:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Their wounds are so severe that there's\Nnot enough fluids left to keep them alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.18,0:02:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,All the FFs in their body are\Nalmost completely wiped out!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.88,0:02:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy none of it spilled.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.92,0:02:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But still, that's unlucky for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.98,0:03:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.02,0:03:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.06,0:03:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,so
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.54,0:03:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,much for watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.45,0:03:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Come and run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.56,0:03:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I am a legendary person!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.56,0:03:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Break out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.47,0:03:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We're coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.39,0:03:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.30,0:03:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.70,0:03:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,believe me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.61,0:03:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Break out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.80,0:04:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What though don't be in the past, No matter\Nwith you in any longer, The goal is the
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.02,0:04:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Regret, keep up and long, the\Nmission is to stand up till.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.88,0:04:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't stop beating!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.64,0:04:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't stop beating!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.90,0:04:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't stop beating!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.20,0:04:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm mad!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.60,0:04:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You're losing your touch, old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.36,0:04:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Never again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.56,0:04:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never be careless and step\Naway from the safe direction again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.28,0:04:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew better than that,\Nand I am better than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.84,0:04:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Son of a...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.90,0:04:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He got away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.22,0:04:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,To a safe direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.06,0:05:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But still...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.56,0:05:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Speaking of directions...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.20,0:05:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm learning something valuable here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.32,0:05:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,How I can best breach them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.62,0:05:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,A mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.68,0:05:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I need a mirror right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.70,0:05:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can create a mirror mid-air,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.62,0:05:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I can beam the dragon's\Nreflection off its surface
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.02,0:05:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,and fool Kenzo into moving\Naway from his safe space.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.22,0:05:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That gives me the perfect window to\Nbeat up that rotting bag of skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.32,0:05:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What I need the most is water.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.90,0:05:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I can use water to make a mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.64,0:05:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Obviously, I need it to\Nrecover from my injuries, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.48,0:05:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,But the only way I can possibly make a\Nmirror mid-air is if I can get some water.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.58,0:05:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,In the not-so-distant past,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.74,0:05:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,some 30,000 loyal disciples of mine\Nworshipped me, eagerly learned my teachings,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.66,0:05:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,and rapidly followed in my footsteps.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.32,0:05:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,But not now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.44,0:05:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since being incarcerated here,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.58,0:05:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,their love and loyalty has\Nturned into pure disgust.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.76,0:05:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone looked down on me,\Nlaughed, and turned away.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.98,0:06:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Even degenerates that\Nabducted children and did
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.58,0:06:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,unspeakable things to them\Nsaw me as beneath them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.02,0:06:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Forty years.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.00,0:06:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Forty long, hard years.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.58,0:06:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.49,0:06:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It was true honor, I tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.84,0:06:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Forty years ago, I was at the\Ntop of the world, a shining star.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.44,0:06:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And my former glory will return, I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.40,0:06:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,My wisdom on feng shui, which rendered\Nme the only survivor of that fire,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.86,0:06:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,appeared in the form of a stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.64,0:06:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,As sure as I'm floating\Nhere glaring at you,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.08,0:06:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,people will soon call me founder once\Nagain, and they will all follow me,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.44,0:06:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,even if I never see\Noutside this prison again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.08,0:06:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The only thing I have left\Nto do now is finish you off.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.52,0:06:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,For the last time, you show me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.72,0:06:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I command you now, Drake to dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.84,0:06:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You will show me the precise\Ndirection of my finishing attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.08,0:06:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Over there, F .F., on the\Nother side of the stairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.04,0:06:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a fire hose,\Nrun and grab it, hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.76,0:07:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, asshole!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.12,0:07:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Instead of just standing there\Nwatching and giving commentary,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.94,0:07:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,you could help out FF!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.52,0:07:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a stand user, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.12,0:07:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The two of you could beat\Nthat old bastard together!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.48,0:07:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll help if FF dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.96,0:07:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Before I came here, helping\NFF was never part of the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.50,0:07:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The sworn agreement was\Nto protect only you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.24,0:07:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And besides, FF said themself\Nnot to step in for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.42,0:07:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,They saw that you were\Ninjured when we got here,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.04,0:07:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,and asked me to protect\Nyou from other dangerous
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.36,0:07:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,enemies who are still\Nin the punishment cells.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.94,0:07:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.04,0:07:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to get the water running now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.94,0:07:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Where the hell is the faucet?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.06,0:07:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful what you touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.04,0:07:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,This is your unlucky direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.16,0:07:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You must protect it fiercely.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.38,0:08:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, a definite\Nattack will head your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.32,0:08:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, there's no time to be doing\Nsomething silly like drinking water.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.60,0:08:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,At their own will!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.98,0:08:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,FF, no! What are you doing? Please stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.90,0:08:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,An attack has already\Nbeen decided, get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.72,0:08:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not going to end well for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.22,0:08:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.02,0:08:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,rather than a decided\Nattack or being led into
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.58,0:08:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,bad luck it looks like\Nmore than anything else
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.52,0:08:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,what ff really needs\Nis water they purposely
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.48,0:08:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,remove their arms to fit\Ntheir body into the hose
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.74,0:08:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,oh they did it they managed to get
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.06,0:09:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,this is your arm feng shui assassination\Nhas now begun ah it's obvious you wanted to
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.44,0:09:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,get some water and clearly you need it but\Ni'm delighted to inform you that nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.96,0:09:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,will go your way anymore my attacks will\Ncontinue to become your bad fortune from
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.58,0:09:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,here on out that's feng shui assassination
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.82,0:09:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Great dream. It's all\Nfree, determined you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.14,0:09:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,cannot stop destiny they almost got water\Nbut then couldn't he wouldn't even let
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.42,0:09:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,them touch it what's\Ngonna happen now directly
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.22,0:09:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,beneath the discipline cell here is the
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.18,0:09:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,execution room remember\Nit's Florida capital
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.24,0:09:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,punishment is a big\Nthing here two or three
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.62,0:09:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,people every year are\Nexecuted by electrocution
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.82,0:09:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,In the chair down in the basement,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.58,0:09:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,and it uses 2800 volts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.36,0:10:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,This sucks, I can't believe I missed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.84,0:10:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I was so close to the water, but I\Nwas able to break the faucet off.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.46,0:10:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll just have to get the\Nwater from up there now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.78,0:10:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,If things don't change...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.32,0:10:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The Planktons would certainly be\Nannihilated in less than a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.14,0:10:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.52,0:10:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this the chair?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.20,0:10:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.06,0:10:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's coming down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.42,0:10:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it already live?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.08,0:10:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What if it's that many turns\Non when the counter hits zero?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.82,0:10:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can help it, it won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.62,0:10:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I was curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.12,0:10:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,After I unleash my attacks, what's\Nthe end going to look like for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.62,0:11:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That situation, anyone could perfectly\Npredict what was going to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.16,0:11:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He could kiss my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.26,0:11:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at the water dripping\Nfrom above before that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.80,0:11:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like it's already been decided.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.02,0:11:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You're supposed to be\Nsitting in that chair.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.98,0:11:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't fight it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.84,0:11:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never get your water, so give\Nup, and the timing's absolutely perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.82,0:11:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The precise time of the finishing blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.46,0:12:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh God, FF!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.40,0:12:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, the definitive direction of attack,\Nand the perfect direction of protection.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.20,0:12:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Feng Shui assassination.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.14,0:12:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It took 40 years to achieve, but this can\Nonly mean that I've finally mastered it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.44,0:12:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The Founder has been resurrected at last!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.68,0:12:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,With this,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.59,0:12:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go down in history as a Buddha\Nequivalent in power and glory to Shaka Muni.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.92,0:12:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm neutral, old man, so it's not like\NI'm gonna help you out or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.24,0:12:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But you see, FF did\Nmanage to obtain water.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.12,0:12:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Mere moments ago, in fact,\Nwhen you kicked them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.38,0:12:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Wanna know how?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.08,0:12:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Because a 78-year-old like\Nyou ran around hysterically,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.36,0:12:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,you perspired abundantly\Nbecause FF made you run around.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.16,0:13:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Your sweat is the water they used.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.98,0:13:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,And you missed it. It appears that
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.46,0:13:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,ff can create mirrors using sweat all
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.70,0:13:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,it takes is about a third of a glass\Nto make a functional one you provided
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.02,0:13:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,more than enough for them in other\Nwords if you're looking at a reflection
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.18,0:13:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,of me that's not at all your safe\Ndirection in fact quite the opposite
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.56,0:13:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,it's an official tie the\Nonly thing that'll seal away
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.08,0:13:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,the perfect feng shui\Nassassination The nation is a tie!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.58,0:13:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,FF made their resolve\Nspecifically for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.78,0:13:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.14,0:13:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,And choke on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.78,0:13:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can share some good fortune with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.18,0:13:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What might I say? The legend!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.02,0:13:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Brian!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.30,0:13:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.86,0:14:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going to happen next?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.96,0:14:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll keep looking for the bone, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.88,0:14:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That's really what you\Nshould be focused on now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.94,0:14:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Silver lining.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.04,0:14:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,At least there's no way Kenzo's feng shui\Nassassination can attack you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.94,0:14:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,despite the sacrifice for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.88,0:14:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We know it was indeed an invincible stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.70,0:14:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Kepa, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.62,0:14:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Preposterous.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.53,0:14:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jolyne Kujo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.80,0:14:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.38,0:14:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The damage your body has suffered is far\Nmore severe and extensive than you realize!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.68,0:14:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Also,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.59,0:14:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,you should know by now that\Nthe planktons inside FF
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.78,0:14:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,were already killed by the\N2800 volts shot through them!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.80,0:14:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You couldn't possibly repair that!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.26,0:14:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The dragon...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.64,0:14:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The dragon...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.68,0:14:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,is still there!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.84,0:14:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,So did they let go of\NKenzo's hand too early?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.44,0:15:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess this happened because planktons\Ncan't handle electricity like humans can.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.98,0:15:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Kenzo, how is he still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.60,0:15:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.94,0:15:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to release\Nyour stand in your condition?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.34,0:15:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Is the raw fury of revenge driving this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.52,0:15:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not leaving him like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.22,0:15:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's end it right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.16,0:15:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't watch it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.22,0:15:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice try, but you'll never hit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.70,0:15:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to annihilate you and then\NI'll be back as the founder at last.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.62,0:15:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I see, so that's how it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.44,0:15:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's patently clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.06,0:15:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,That's his safe direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.78,0:15:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.92,0:15:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You were trying to figure out\Nthe place Kenzo just escaped to.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.24,0:15:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can track down the actual safe\Nspot that's protected from all attacks,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.24,0:15:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Then the FFs that scattered,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.26,0:15:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,along with the sweat that they\Nused to create the mirror,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.22,0:16:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,should still be safe and intact there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.62,0:16:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It should have been safe even\Nfrom the 2800-volt surge.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.66,0:16:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You attacked the old man\Nto find that exact spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.02,0:16:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,FF survived!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.34,0:16:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I fucking knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.10,0:16:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy shit, that's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.62,0:16:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.88,0:16:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you truly think you've beaten me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.18,0:16:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You believe you could force me to\Nsurrender with that pathetic attempt?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.70,0:16:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to finish you off, Jolene Kujo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.26,0:16:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,My plan to do so has never wavered.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.32,0:16:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You will never get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.88,0:16:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you refuse to see?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.98,0:16:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You're already lying in the dead center of
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.16,0:16:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,the direction of my\NFeng Shui assassination.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.64,0:16:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no escape, so you\Nmight as well give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.84,0:16:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Stone Ocean's threat is finding\Nits way inside the dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.50,0:16:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,My attack is imminent, woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.60,0:16:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Your bad fortune is an absolute reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.40,0:17:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what attack\NI choose to use on you,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.18,0:17:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,your demise has been chosen\Nand you cannot evade it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.10,0:17:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I won!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.80,0:17:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Bow down before me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.10,0:17:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no change in\Nreviving the Founder either!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.54,0:17:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,AAAAAAAAHHHHH!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.74,0:17:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.10,0:17:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.01,0:17:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I hit her, didn't I, Drake's dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.64,0:17:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,All you have to do is confirm it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.42,0:17:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,My instant death kick!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.74,0:17:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It hit Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.96,0:17:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means my Feng Shui\Nassassination is definite and true!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.66,0:17:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Speak, you silly lizard! Am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.46,0:17:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, your finishing blow\Ndefinitely smashed right into her!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.96,0:17:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why is Jolene safe and\Nsound down there and I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.18,0:17:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,barely clinging on to this\Nrailing like a broken spider?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.44,0:17:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Dragon, tell me the safe direction now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.64,0:18:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait, dragon, come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.50,0:18:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you drifting away?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.28,0:18:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me my safe direction\Nand hurry up! But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.36,0:18:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you coming with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.62,0:18:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who wants to\Nsay those words, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.12,0:18:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one drifting away.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.80,0:18:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one who let go voluntarily\Nand started falling to the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.30,0:18:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You have no one to blame\NBut yourself you fool
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.24,0:18:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you give the direction\Nto me and I told you you're
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.56,0:18:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,the one drifting away from\Nme old man I can't help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.06,0:18:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, about your legs,\Nthey look very strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.00,0:18:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,There must be something\Nterribly wrong with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.44,0:18:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,When you were kicking Jolene before, did\Nthey perhaps do something to your legs?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.84,0:18:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.86,0:19:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.62,0:19:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I know what Jolene's threat stand\Nlooks like and that's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.92,0:19:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it possibly be?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.44,0:19:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The stand that's emerging\Nfrom inside Jolene is...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.20,0:19:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Dive or a drive, and I ensure\Nthat it dove into her body itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.00,0:19:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,See, if a particular attack\Non Jolene has been decided,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.72,0:19:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,then that just means I protect her right\Nwhen the kick lands, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.52,0:19:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.12,0:19:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,My name!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.26,0:19:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,This man that FF brought\Nwith them, Anastasia.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.00,0:19:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He slipped his own powerful\Nstand into my body,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.12,0:19:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,and then it permanently destroyed\Nboth of Kenzo's legs like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.68,0:19:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He basically turned his flesh and\Nbones into a giant pile of plasma.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.28,0:20:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Then just as quickly, he reassembled\Nthem into functional springs.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.32,0:20:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,A suspension of flesh and bone!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.80,0:20:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Kenzo doesn't feel pain right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.72,0:20:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That goes for me too,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.84,0:20:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,because of the stand that made the\Nprisoners and guards fight each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.04,0:20:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Although...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.28,0:20:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,She spared nothing, even my hips!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.54,0:20:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me my safe direction, dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.90,0:20:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.81,0:20:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't reach!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.73,0:20:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't go that way!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.76,0:20:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy is an ally?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.30,0:20:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,A guy who would do something so brutal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.86,0:20:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, who is he, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.98,0:20:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.98,0:20:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, this is perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.74,0:20:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You just keep looking at\Nme with those pretty eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.20,0:21:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't take your eyes off of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.74,0:21:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,your safe direction is northeast and your
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.80,0:21:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,lucky color cerulean blue\Nbut i must inform you
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.84,0:21:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,you're all out of chances\Nin only a few minutes
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.24,0:21:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,of battle you've aged\Nexponentially further
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.52,0:21:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Although you think I cope.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.42,0:21:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,My head is filled with hope
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.26,0:21:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Of some place
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.10,0:22:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,other than he
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.40,0:22:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Although you think I smile
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.70,0:22:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Inside and all the while
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.94,0:22:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm wondering about my destiny
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.86,0:22:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.88,0:22:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,about all the
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.56,0:22:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,things I'd like
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.44,0:22:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,to do in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.86,0:22:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a dreamer
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.32,0:22:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,A distant dreamer
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.20,0:22:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Dreaming far away
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.32,0:23:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,From today
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.32,0:23:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene! Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.66,0:23:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-yeah, I just started to\Nfeel a lot of pain suddenly.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.70,0:23:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But we need to find them now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.16,0:23:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, the bone and the\Nlittle guy that picked it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.88,0:23:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Just wait a few minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.08,0:23:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna repair your wounds now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.68,0:23:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.46,0:23:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to get it back and fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.02,0:23:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It has Tad's disc.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.70,0:23:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.78,0:24:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
